Attempt 1 top-level exit status: 1

The six official tight detector shards completed and produced their JSON/CSV
artifacts. The experiment then failed before broad measurement because the
ProcessPool workers did not have the OmegaSim repository root on `sys.path`:

ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'scripts'

The failure occurred in experiment-local `broad_task` while importing
`scripts.run_cla_detector.evaluate_trace`. Recovery adds only the OmegaSim
repository root to worker `sys.path`, validates and reuses the completed tight
artifacts without overwriting them, and leaves the frozen detector unchanged.
